# Used by BuildKit for `docker build -f deploy/docker/worker.Dockerfile CONTEXT` (CONTEXT: the
# directory deploy/scripts/build_artifacts.py stages, which already holds only what the build
# needs). Defence in depth: account state, keys and build products never enter the context.
# (No `**/target`: some vendored crates have source directories of that name; the staging step
# leaves the crates' build directories out instead.)
**/.git
**/.lake
**/__pycache__
**/Player-Data
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.share
**/*.env
src/real_signal
src/local_signal_server/state
src/local_signal_server/logs
src/local_signal_server/third_party
